<title>USA: STI sees merger, acquisition candidates.</title>
<headline>STI sees merger, acquisition candidates.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>STI Inc, a custom injection molder of plastics, on Thursday said it identified several acquisition and merger candidates as part of an effort to increase shareholder value.</p>
<p>The company said it retained Chicago-based Armand Group, an investment banking company, in August to explore strategic and financial alternatives.</p>
<p>&quot;We realize the need to increase the value of the company and are confident that Armand Group will be able to assist us in our efforts,&quot; Chairman George Stodola said in a statement.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
